<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1879439665"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:29.649"><div begin="20.629" end="50.074" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="20.629" end="26.745" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.629" end="21.796">张开眼睛</span><span begin="21.852" end="23.263">泪水溃堤</span> <span begin="23.413" end="24.564">学会哭</span><span begin="24.650" end="25.847">但不懂放</span><span begin="25.847" end="26.745">弃</span></p><p begin="28.221" end="34.245" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.221" end="29.333">有人放我</span><span begin="29.387" end="30.899">城市独居</span> <span begin="31.132" end="33.380">吻过还是选择别</span><span begin="33.380" end="34.245">离</span></p><p begin="35.812" end="41.926" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.812" end="37.047">张开拥抱</span><span begin="37.117" end="38.486">无人靠近</span> <span begin="38.607" end="40.909">学会享受孤单的道</span><span begin="40.909" end="41.926">理</span></p><p begin="43.492" end="50.074" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.492" end="44.836">有人纵容我</span><span begin="44.836" end="46.095">在抗拒</span> <span begin="46.501" end="48.607">却仍然不给消</span><span begin="48.607" end="50.074">息</span></p></div><div begin="52.929" end="1:09.702" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="52.929" end="59.117" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.929" end="54.156">如果无法</span><span begin="54.179" end="55.620">克服难题</span> <span begin="55.797" end="57.951">别用假象勉强继</span><span begin="57.951" end="59.117">续</span></p><p begin="1:00.596" end="1:03.191" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.596" end="1:01.689">爱情不是</span><span begin="1:01.689" end="1:03.191">谁都能免疫</span></p><p begin="1:03.461" end="1:09.702" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.461" end="1:05.570">只能在失去边缘</span> <span begin="1:06.524" end="1:07.785">找一点抗</span><span begin="1:07.785" end="1:09.702">体</span></p></div><div begin="1:10.626" end="1:25.600" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:10.626" end="1:14.416" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.626" end="1:11.584">我被爱</span><span begin="1:11.584" end="1:12.500">反锁</span> <span begin="1:12.500" end="1:14.416">走不出伤痛</span></p><p begin="1:14.806" end="1:17.991" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.806" end="1:17.079">谁也没有钥匙放我</span><span begin="1:17.079" end="1:17.991">自由</span></p><p begin="1:18.234" end="1:22.256" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.234" end="1:19.874">回忆的困兽</span> <span begin="1:20.037" end="1:21.053">野蛮又</span><span begin="1:21.053" end="1:21.815">悸</span><span begin="1:21.815" end="1:22.256">动</span></p><p begin="1:22.481" end="1:25.600" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.481" end="1:23.989">冲撞我的世界</span><span begin="1:23.989" end="1:25.600">无法闪躲</span></p></div><div begin="1:25.870" end="1:45.558" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:25.870" end="1:29.674" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.870" end="1:27.752">我被你反锁</span> <span begin="1:27.752" end="1:28.757">用你的</span><span begin="1:28.757" end="1:29.674">温柔</span></p><p begin="1:30.071" end="1:33.189" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.071" end="1:31.552">虽然真的假的</span><span begin="1:31.552" end="1:33.189">让我疑惑</span></p><p begin="1:33.447" end="1:37.762" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.447" end="1:34.333">放不下</span><span begin="1:34.333" end="1:35.512">舍不得</span> <span begin="1:35.650" end="1:36.985">都是短篇小</span><span begin="1:36.985" end="1:37.762">说</span></p><p begin="1:38.555" end="1:45.558" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.555" end="1:39.460">结局是</span><span begin="1:39.460" end="1:40.419">什么</span> <span begin="1:40.465" end="1:41.575">我们怎么</span><span begin="1:41.575" end="1:42.523">说</span> <span begin="1:42.896" end="1:43.237">都</span><span begin="1:43.237" end="1:45.558">错</span></p></div><div begin="1:57.772" end="2:11.920" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:57.772" end="2:03.766" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.772" end